WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You wrote an op-ed in "The Ne
York Times" talking about

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:06.773 size:88% position:44%
the escalating violence
between Israel and Gaza.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.441 line:92%
This is a terrible situation

00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:10.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know that President Bide
reached out

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
to Benjamin Netanyahu
and urged him to de-escalate

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you feel like that messag
is getting through,

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:22.088
and do you feel like
President Biden is doing enough?

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:26.426 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think we need
an immediate cease-fire, Seth.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:29.729 align:start size:94% position:6%
The situation there
is absolutely terrible.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:34.367 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just talked to somebody
in Gaza yesterday.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's not only
the loss of lives.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:40.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
Several hundred Palestinians
have been killed.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.641 line:92%
12 Israelis have been killed

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:46.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
But in Gaza, you are
talking about a situation no

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
where people
don't have electricity.

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:50.150 size:78% position:39% line:92%
They don't have fuel.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.751 line:92%
They don't have clean water.

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:54.120 size:84% position:42%
Their wastewater plants
have been destroyed,

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
and fetid excrement is
coming out into the streets.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:01.561 line:92%
You have a horrible situation,

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:04.464 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that's built on
the terrible situation

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:06.499 line:92%
that existed before the conflict

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
where youth unemployment
was 70%.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
So you've got a total disaster
there.

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:15.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I think that what the
function of where we should be

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:19.646
especially when we're giving
$4 billion a year to Israel,

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:22.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
is we should be
bringing people together,

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:25.218
not just being one-sided
and saying everything that

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:28.455 size:75% position:38%
Israel does is good,
because it is not.

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:31.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
Over the years,
Netanyahu and his government

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:34.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
have become
much more right wing.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:38.031 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have overt racists
who are now

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:41.901 line:92%
part of Netanyahu's coalition,

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:44.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
and what the United States
has got to say is

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:47.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Look, it's a difficult
situation.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's gone on for decades.
No magical answer.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.378
But you guys are going to have
to come together and develop

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:54.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
a long-term plan
that provides dignity

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:59.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the Palestinian people
safety for the Israeli people.

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.787 line:92%
We've got to be pro-Israel

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:02.622 line:92%
We've got to be pro-Palestinian.

00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:08.161
But I think just being one-sided
is wrong,

00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:10.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it is not productive
in terms of

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:11.931 line:92%
bringing peace to the region

00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:13.500 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, one of the things
you write about,

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I think on a human level
we can all agree

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:19.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
that everyone, be they
Palestinian, be they Israeli

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:23.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
deserves safety,
deserves security.

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:25.845 line:92%
And they have a right to that.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:26.646 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You denounce Hamas.

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:31.184
Obviously no one is on the sid
of shooting rockets into Israel.

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:33.486 size:75% position:38%
But the Palestinians
have been let down

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.587 line:92%
by Hamas as a government.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:37.991
And Hamas does not represent
all Palestinians in the same way

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:41.261
that Benjamin Netanyahu
does not represent all Israelis.

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:43.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of the things that becomes
really fraught is that

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:45.865 size:84% position:42%
when people criticize
the Israeli government,

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:49.002
it can somehow -- and sometimes,
I should say instead of

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:52.105
somehow -- can sometimes
be framed as anti-Semitic.

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:55.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
How do we have these
conversations, making it clear

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:58.912 size:78% position:39%
to our Jewish friends
or Jewish family that

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:04.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
this is not anti-Semitism to b
specifically critical abou

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:07.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
steps or actions
that a government makes?

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:13.259
-Anti-Semitism is a very serious
issue and it's a growing issue

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.228 size:78% position:39%
in the United States
and around the world.

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:19.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
But criticizing the government
of Israel does not make yo

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:26.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
anti-Semitic anymore
than it makes you pro-Hama

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:28.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you talk about
the terrible destruction

00:03:28.575 --> 00:03:30.743 line:92%
now taking place in Gaza.

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:34.113 line:92%
Look, we have -- Trump is gone

00:03:34.113 --> 00:03:38.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I hope to see a new face
in our foreign policy,

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:43.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
and that is an approach that
brings the world together

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:46.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
and understands that we got to
deal with climate change.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:48.828 line:92%
We got to get the vaccines out

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:50.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
to poor countries
around the world.

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:51.664 align:start size:94% position:6%
We should be
leading that effort.

00:03:51.664 --> 00:03:54.033 size:84% position:42%
And in the Middle East,
it is difficult, Seth.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, good people
have worked on this issue

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:58.171 line:92%
for decades without success.

00:03:58.171 --> 00:04:01.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
But the current situation
is unsustainable.

00:04:01.374 --> 00:04:06.846
If you have massive misery and
70% youth unemployment in Gaza

00:04:06.846 --> 00:04:10.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
do you not --
do you doubt for a second

00:04:10.416 --> 00:04:13.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
that there will be
more and more unrest?

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:16.189 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we have got to figure out
a way to bring

00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:18.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
Israel
and the Palestinians together.

00:04:18.491 --> 00:04:22.695
Understand that Hamas is not
only a terrorist organization.

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:25.098 size:78% position:39% line:92%
It is. It is corrupt.

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:26.766 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It is ineffective.

00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:28.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they do not reflect,
I think,

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:31.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
the wishes of
the Palestinian people.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:34.073 align:start size:94% position:6%
And in Israel,
to complicate the problem,

00:04:34.073 --> 00:04:38.645
you have a government more and
more right wing under Netanyahu.

00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:40.480 line:92%
So this is not easy stuff,

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.349 align:start size:94% position:6%
but as the most powerful natio
on Earth,

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:45.652 size:88% position:44%
we've got to do our best
to bring people together

00:04:45.652 --> 00:04:49.155 size:88% position:44%
and finally bring peace
to that troubled region.

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:50.523 line:92%
-I would like to stress as well,

00:04:50.523 --> 00:04:53.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's very easy to talk about i
from behind a desk here.

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:57.597 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I certainly don't thin
it's easy, and I send my wishe

00:04:57.597 --> 00:05:02.702
