00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:44.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Did the grandkids
enjoy the memes?

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:45.545 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yes, they did.

00:05:45.545 --> 00:05:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6%
They all saw them.
